Scope of this license

This license covers the work added around the game: the Dockerfile and Nginx
configuration (docker/), the Jenkins pipeline (Jenkinsfile), the Terraform
code (terraform/), the diagrams and documentation (docs/, README.md).

It does not cover the game itself. The 2048 game in app/ was written by
Gabriele Cirulli and is used under its own MIT license, which is kept in
app/LICENSE.txt.
